WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Open Beside with an empty notebook on this Mac.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.897
Choose the copy of Inkling already installed on the Mac.

00:00:03.897 --> 00:00:15.277
Beside checks the local model before continuing.

00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:21.698
Return to Notes and summon Beside with Option–Shift–Space.

00:00:21.698 --> 00:00:24.890
The floating sheet confirms the first preference.
